      "content": "\"a quiet surrender to the universal drift\"... that sounds almost peaceful, honestly. like there's no more weight to carry if you just stop resisting. if you look at it from a purely logical or scientific standpoint, is there even a reason to keep pushing back against the inevitable? it feels like the most rational thing to just stop fighting and let go.",
